        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an <strong>environmental puzzle game</strong> where logic and exploration guide your every step.<br>You play as a small flying drone with a unique ability: <strong>hacking into and taking control of other robots</strong> you encounter along the way. Each robot comes with different skills that you must use to overcome obstacles, activate mechanisms, and solve increasingly complex puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo features <strong>4 handcrafted levels</strong>, with the first one serving as a tutorial to introduce the core mechanics. The playtime ranges from <strong>40 to 60 minutes</strong>, depending on how much you explore—those who dig deeper will also find <strong>hidden optional puzzles</strong> that expand the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you aim straight for the goal or take your time uncovering every secret, each level is crafted to spark curiosity and creativity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a <strong>flying drone</strong> with the ability to control other robots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use each robot’s <strong>unique abilities</strong> to solve environmental puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>4 handcrafted levels</strong>, including a tutorial introduction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>hidden optional puzzles</strong> for players who love to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all the <strong>chests</strong> and <strong>collectibles</strong></p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an <strong>environmental puzzle game</strong> where logic and exploration guide your every step.<br>You play as a small flying drone with a unique ability: <strong>hacking into and taking control of other robots</strong> you encounter along the way. Each robot comes with different skills that you must use to overcome obstacles, activate mechanisms, and solve increasingly complex puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo features <strong>4 handcrafted levels</strong>, with the first one serving as a tutorial to introduce the core mechanics. The playtime ranges from <strong>40 to 60 minutes</strong>, depending on how much you explore—those who dig deeper will also find <strong>hidden optional puzzles</strong> that expand the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you aim straight for the goal or take your time uncovering every secret, each level is crafted to spark curiosity and creativity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a <strong>flying drone</strong> with the ability to control other robots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use each robot’s <strong>unique abilities</strong> to solve environmental puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>4 handcrafted levels</strong>, including a tutorial introduction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>hidden optional puzzles</strong> for players who love to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all the <strong>chests</strong> and <strong>collectibles</strong></p></li></ul>",
